  "question": {
    "text": "A solid sphere of radius R and density&nbsp;&rho; is attached to one end of a mass-less spring of force constant k. The other end of the spring is connected to another solid sphere of radius R and density 3 &rho; The complete arrangement is placed in a liquid of density 2&rho; and is allowed to reach equilibrium. The correct statement(s) is (are)",
